<title>UK: SIG buys remaining 50 pct stake in Golinski.</title>
<headline>SIG buys remaining 50 pct stake in Golinski.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SIG said it exercised its option to buy the remaining 50 percent stake not already owned in Germany's Golinski Group for 27 million marks.  </p>
<p>SIG, a distributor of insulation products, bought the first 50 percent in Golinski in March.</p>
<p>&quot;Since acquisition, we have been encouraged by the sales performances shown,&quot; said SIG chief executive Bill Forrester.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
